    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dd5865e8f8f138ea1165384",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出现在我面前的是强击的姐姐们——\n极峰和高尚骏逸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "972be1e6dd92dacd679250f222e44fa0213c34d7f54c03323cbd143f9bbc1a4c",
