    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ca62601692be95931e60c18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最大的姐姐极峰。\n她是活跃在后冠路线，\n有着GⅠ赛事连霸战绩的伟大马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35582591a6977995c5de25d347b1056f9961edb7578ee748467dbd8e963d0486",
