    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3299343265149e94f5d2605",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "朝着闪耀系列赛进发，\n强击和训练员签约了。\n第二天——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e41ec4e6c62e5cf95f301f95875f1b10d0979210ba212554ec5f15d5fe293439",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1091/storytimeline_501091100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0a6d538bd2f1144b7192841",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "强击的父母都是社会上的有名人士。\n我在电视上曾多次看到他们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b456da5612e973610e5c1a49165baf45b6a869bac0bbfbdf61ddbb0717464248",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1091/storytimeline_501091100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:423be044a88461636fceceac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "父亲是现役的棒球选手，\n以豪放磊落又爱护妻子而闻名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6bcbcb8d90275c10dc0b4c73baa24984f24a8180d5091cbc0495cabfbf20b5e",
